            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/santabarbara/santabarbara_pdb2_vr_ti.json",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@FrankChen4@quantatw.com Can you please confirm this is the only inventory source for PDB fans and there is no other source (such as EEPROM based via fru-device)? Want to make sure we don't end up with double inventory entries."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/santabarbara/santabarbara_pdb2_vr_ti.json",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Frank Chen",
                        "email": "FrankChen4@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "Itad268"
                    },
                    "message": "Confirmed. These PDB fans are only detected via GPIODeviceDetect.\n\nThere is no EEPROM-based FRU device or other inventory source\n(frudevice/entity-manager/etc.) for these PDB fan entries.\n\nExample inventory entry after fan insertion:\n```\nroot@bmc:~# mfg-tool inventory 2>/dev/null | jq 'with_entries(select(.key | test(\"PDB2_FAN\")))'\n{\n  \"system/board/PDB2_FAN4\": {\n \u00a0\u00a0 \"Decorator.Asset\": {\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"Manufacturer\": \"Unknown\",\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"Model\": \"Unknown\",\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"PartNumber\": \"Unknown\",\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"SerialNumber\": \"Unknown\",\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"SparePartNumber\": \"05-100368\"\n \u00a0\u00a0 },\n \u00a0\u00a0 \"Item.Board\": {\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"Name\": \"PDB2_FAN4\",\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \"Type\": \"Board\"\n \u00a0\u00a0 }\n  }\n}\n```"
                }
            ],
